      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\because \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} f(x) dx = 1,\\ \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} x f(x) dx = 0.75,\\\\&amp;\\because \\int_{0}^{1} kx^a dx = 1,\\ \\int_{0}^{1} x-kx^a dx = 0.75,\\ \\text{即} \\\\&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\\frac{k}{a+1}x^{a+1}\\vert_{0}^{1} = 1,\\ \\frac{k}{a+2}x^{a+2}\\vert_{0}^{1} = 0.75,\\\\&amp;\\text{即}\\ \\begin{cases}\\frac{k}{a+1} = 1\\\\ \\frac{k}{a+2} = 0.75\\end{cases},\\\\&amp;\\therefore k=3,\\ a=2.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\because \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} f(x) dx = 1,\\ \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} x f(x) dx = 0.75,\\\\&amp;\\because \\int_{0}^{1} kx^a dx = 1,\\ \\int_{0}^{1} x-kx^a dx = 0.75,\\ \\text{即} \\\\&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\\frac{k}{a+1}x^{a+1}\\vert_{0}^{1} = 1,\\ \\frac{k}{a+2}x^{a+2}\\vert_{0}^{1} = 0.75,\\\\&amp;\\text{即}\\ \\begin{cases}\\frac{k}{a+1} = 1\\\\ \\frac{k}{a+2} = 0.75\\end{cases},\\\\&amp;\\therefore k=3,\\ a=2.\\end{aligned}</div>"
